"""add toys-to-life tables and seed LEGO Dimensions

Revision ID: c8e2a4f6b0d1
Revises: b5d7f9a1c3e6
Create Date: 2026-11-01 12:00:00.000000

Creates the Toys-to-Life catalog (toys_to_life_items) plus your own state on it — copies (owned or
wishlisted, with a price and notes), notes and tags — and seeds every LEGO Dimensions pack from
docs/data/toys_to_life/LEGO_Dimensions_Packs.csv (normally re-loaded with
`python -m scripts.import_toys_to_life`), same bake-the-CSV-in pattern as the hardware
reference seeds. `INSERT OR IGNORE` on the (line, set_number) unique key keeps it safe against
a DB that already has the rows from a manual import.
"""
